@startuml
participant "Kernel Core" as Kernel
participant "Platform Abstraction" as Platform
participant "Memory Protection Service" as MPU
participant "Health Monitor" as Health
participant "Priority Scheduler" as Scheduler
participant "Diagnostic Manager" as Diagnostics
Kernel -> Platform : initialize clocks and timer
Kernel -> Platform : run startup self check
Platform --> Kernel : self check result
Kernel -> MPU : configure task regions
MPU --> Kernel : region table ready
Kernel -> Health : report startup checkpoints
Health --> Kernel : startup accepted
Kernel -> Scheduler : admit safety tasks
Scheduler --> Kernel : ready queue initialized
Kernel -> Diagnostics : record boot complete
@enduml
